=== 2b. DECISIVE -- joint magnitude+phase fit on EACH branch ===
  A min-phase cascade has no freedom left once both magnitude and phase are in
  the cost. If one branch is fitted to the capture floor in magnitude AND to a
  few degrees in phase while the other cannot be, the branch is SELECTED by the
  data and the required correction IS approximately minimum-phase => realisable.
